<title>JAPAN: Nichiro Corp files 15 bln yen shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Nichiro Corp files 15 bln yen shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nichiro Corp, which imports and processes fish products, said on Wednesday that it had applied the Finance Ministry for a shelf registration to issue up to 15 billion yen of corporate bonds.</p>
<p>The registration would be effective for two years from February 5, it said.</p>
